+        as_json: Whether to output the report as JSON.
+        as_markdown: Whether to output the report as Markdown.
+        current_version: A version string to print bumped, if given.
+        fail_on: Exit nonzero when the recommendation meets this level.
+        ignore: Top-level public names to exclude from the comparison.
